---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import { disclosure, fdaDisclaimer, storeUrl, updated } from "../data/site";

const title = "Terms | GreenVanta";
const description =
  "Terms for using the GreenVanta website: product information, Amazon purchases, affiliate disclosure, and no medical advice.";
---

<BaseLayout title={title} description={description}>
  <article class="legal">
    <div class="wrap legal-body">
      <header>
        <p class="eyebrow">Terms</p>
        <h1>Terms of use</h1>
        <p class="updated">Last updated {updated}.</p>
      </header>

      <section>
        <h2>An informational site</h2>
        <p>
          These pages describe GreenVanta moringa capsules and GreenVanta
          mushroom coffee. They are here so you can read the label details before
          you decide whether to visit Amazon. Using the site means you accept
          these terms. If you do not, please leave the site.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>Where the sale happens</h2>
        <p>
          GreenVanta does not sell products through this website. There is no
          cart, no checkout, and no charge placed here. A buy button opens an
          Amazon listing. The seller shown on that listing, the price, shipping,
          returns, and the purchase contract are Amazon’s and the seller’s, not
          a checkout on this domain.
        </p>
        <p>
          At the time these pages were written, both listings were sold by
          GREENVANTA. Marketplace details can change. The listing you open is
          the current record.
        </p>
        <p>
          <a href={storeUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GreenVanta’s Amazon store</a>
          collects the same two products in one place.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>Affiliate disclosure</h2>
        <p>
          {disclosure} That relationship does not raise the price you see on
          Amazon, and it does not change the instruction to read the package.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>Product information</h2>
        <p>
          We describe servings, ingredients, caffeine, and directions from the
          Amazon listings and the product images reviewed on {updated}. Makers
          update labels. If a bottle or a stick disagrees with this website,
          follow the package you have and the listing you are buying from.
        </p>
        <p>
          This site does not publish a price, because prices change. It does not
          reprint customer reviews. It links to them instead.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>No medical advice</h2>
        <p>
          Nothing on this site is medical, dietary, or professional advice.
          GreenVanta does not promise that either product will affect energy,
          immunity, focus, sleep, or any other health outcome. {fdaDisclaimer}
        </p>
        <p>
          Talk with a qualified clinician before using a dietary supplement,
          especially if you are pregnant, nursing, giving something to a child,
          or taking medicine. The moringa label says to keep the bottle out of
          reach of children and not to use it if the safety seal is damaged or
          missing.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>Allergens and diet marks</h2>
        <p>
          The coffee ingredient list includes coconut milk, and the drink is
          caffeinated. Diet marks such as vegan, dairy-free, gluten-free, or
          sugar-free appear on the Amazon listing or its graphics. This website
          reports those marks. It does not issue or verify a certification seal.
          Read the package if you avoid a food.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>Intellectual property</h2>
        <p>
          The GreenVanta name, wordmark, and product photography are used here
          to present the brand. You may not copy the site design, text, or
          images for your own storefront. Amazon’s trademarks remain Amazon’s.
          Linking to a listing is not a claim that Amazon sponsors this site.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>Liability</h2>
        <p>
          The site is provided as a reading copy of product information. To the
          extent the law allows, GreenVanta is not liable for decisions you make
          from these pages, for Amazon’s fulfillment, or for differences between
          a page and a package. Some places do not allow certain limits, and in
          those places the limit applies only as far as the law permits.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>Changes</h2>
        <p>
          These terms can be updated by changing this page and its date. The
          version you are reading is the one that applies to your use of the
          site today.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
